  "Solution": "A linear equation in two variables must contain two unknowns, each of degree 1, and must be a polynomial equation. The degree of \\(xy\\) is 2, the degree of \\(x^2\\) is 2, and \\(1/x\\) is not a polynomial. Only \\(x+y=5\\) meets the requirements.",
